OL,3,AMedia outlets banned by Trump denied
OL,4,Aaccess to White House dinner despite
OL,5,Ajudge's order
OL,6,
OL,7,FCNN and MS NOW reporters say they have
OL,8,Fbeen denied entry to cover a White
OL,9,FHouse state dinner despite a judge
OL,10,Fruling their access to the grounds must
OL,11,Fbe restored.
OL,13,FA federal judge said in an overnight
OL,14,Fruling that the White House ban on
OL,15,Fthree outlets - CNN and MS NOW and
OL,16,FPolitico - was likely unconstitutional
OL,17,Fand that the administration must allow
OL,18,Fthem access, for now. Trump barred them
OL,19,Flast week, accusing them of "fake
OL,20,Fnews".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
